        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Yellow block crystals of (2) were obtained under the same hydrothermal conditions and experimental procedures as (1), using La(NO3)3·6H2O in place of MnCl2·4H2O at a molar ratio La(NO3)3·6H2O/phen/3,5-(NO2)2sal/ethanol/H2O = 1:0.4:0.4:22:333. For (1), the hydrothermal treatment was MnCl2·4H2O (1 mmol), 1,10-phenanthroline (0.5 mmol), 3,5-dinitrosalicylic acid (1 mmol), absolute ethanol (1 ml) and H2O (6 ml) at 140 °C for 24 h.",
